# Cursor AI Rules — GDG on Campus AJCE
# Master Reference: AGENTS.md, HEAD.md, design.md

# 1. 100% Google Stack Invariant
- Persistent storage: Cloud Firestore (lib/firebase.ts) exclusively.
- Authentication: Firebase Auth with Google SSO (@amaljyothi.ac.in).
- Storage: Firebase Cloud Storage.
- AI & LLMs: Google Gemini SDK (@google/genai, lib/gemini.ts).
- Strict Prohibition: NEVER import Supabase, MongoDB, AWS, Clerk, Auth0, or PostgreSQL.

# 2. Design System Tokens (design.md)
- Canvas: Warm Cream Paper (#f5f1e4). No dark mode. No stark digital white canvas.
- Cards: Pure White (#ffffff) with rounded-[36px] to rounded-[50px] and hairline borders (#d5d5d4).
- Brand Accents: Grass Green (#8ed462), Coral Pop (#ff705d), Sky Pop (#2ba0ff), Sunshine Yellow (#ffd600).
- Buttons & Pills: rounded-full (50px).
- Typography: Inter with compressed tracking (-0.065em).

# 3. Graphify Knowledge Graph
- Query graphify-out/ before refactoring (graphify query "<question>").
- Update graph after code changes (graphify update .).

# 4. Guardrails & Safety
- Use lib/guardrails.ts for prompt validation, PII redaction, and Gemini safety thresholds.
- Adhere to .coderabbit.yaml for PR reviews and SkillSpector security checks.
